(7416137, 1169269, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely image Anita. Heartfelt commiserations. I submitted an entry and realized only a short time before roll over that my main image was taken 2 hours too early. By the time I pulled it out and went to work on something else I missed getting back in before rollover. I really liked the idea of this challenge and I think maybe I get the dummy award?</td>', 'Lovely image Anita. Heartfelt commiserations. I submitted an entry and realized only a short time before roll over that my main image was taken 2 hours too early. By the time I pulled it out and went to work on something else I missed getting back in before rollover. I really liked the idea of this challenge and I think maybe I get the dummy award?', '2015-11-13 19:17:57.000000', NULL, 0),
